{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"file_impact":[{"path":"infra/terraform/main.tf","reason":"Declare the gate-scratch EBS volume, its attachment, the user_data template vars, and the volume-id output."},{"path":"infra/terraform/variables.tf","reason":"Add gate_scratch_volume_size_gb and gate_scratch_mount variables."},{"path":"infra/terraform/user_data.sh","reason":"Resolve, format and mount the scratch volume by UUID; fail loud if it is not a mount; write the declaration and proof markers."},{"path":"infra/terraform/monitoring_autodeploy.tf","reason":"Add the scratch disk-used and mounted-heartbeat CloudWatch alarms beside the root-disk alarm."},{"path":"infra/compose/docker-compose.yml","reason":"Set review-bot REBAR_GATE_TMPDIR and TMPDIR to the scratch path and bind the scratch mount's parent into the container."},{"path":"infra/scripts/compose-up.sh","reason":"Pre-create the scratch parent host directory so the bind mount resolves."},{"path":"infra/scripts/observability.sh","reason":"Publish the scratch mount disk_used_percent and the gate_scratch_mounted heartbeat."},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/gate_admission.py","reason":"Refuse admission when the scratch volume is declared but not mounted, before any store mkdir touches the root filesystem."},{"path":"infra/runbooks/review-bot-ops.md","reason":"Document the scratch location, the two alarms, the refusal, and recovery."},{"path":"infra/runbooks/provision-restore.md","reason":"Document scratch volume provisioning and its rebuildable-data posture."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_gate_scratch_volume_aa40.py","reason":"New test module: the unmounted-volume refusal, the no-marker no-op, compose wiring, and the Terraform/user-data shape."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_alarm_actions_terraform.py","reason":"Extend the existing alarm guard with the two new alarms and raised anti-vacuity floors."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_gate_admission_09da.py","reason":"Extend S6's admission suite if the new pre-check changes its fixtures."},{"path":"tests/scripts/test_observability_disk_pressure.py","reason":"Assert the scratch metric and mounted heartbeat are published by the real observability.sh."}]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"FILE_IMPACT","timestamp":1788523477336367001,"uuid":"f24d3409-26a4-4272-aa20-4e51a3defe3c"}